          {
            "title": "Question: req.method",
            "id": 121770,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jak uzyskać dostęp do parametru trasy o nazwie <code>name</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.method</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>req.params.name</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.route</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.path</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>req.params.name</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Twoja trasa to <code>/users/:name</code>. Wysyłasz żądanie do <code>/users/Maria?name=Lin</code>.</p><p>Jaką wartość zawiera <code>req.params.name</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Maria</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Lin</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>/users/Maria</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>undefined</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>Maria</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2 - Copy - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132659,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uzupełnij adres URL, aby zawierał dwa parametry zapytania.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"http://localhost:3000/product?category=electronics&amp;brand=Samsung\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"|\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>?</code>, a następnie <code>&amp;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wyślij <code>electronics</code> jako <code>category</code>, a <code>Samsung</code> jako <code>brand</code>, w tej kolejności.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"http://localhost:3000/product?category=electronics&amp;brand=Samsung\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"|\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>?</code>, następnie <code>category</code>, <code>&amp;</code> i na końcu <code>brand</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: req.hostname",
            "id": 121778,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jak uzyskać dostęp do parametru zapytania o nazwie <code>path</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.hostname</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"true\"><code>req.query.path</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.host</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.route</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>req.query.path</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Twoja trasa to <code>/files/:path</code>. Wysyłasz żądanie do <code>/files/docs?path=images</code>.</p><p>Jaką wartość zawiera <code>req.query.path</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>images</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>docs</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>path</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>undefined</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>images</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: app.get()",
            "id": 121773,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj parametry obiektów żądania i odpowiedzi do funkcji zwrotnej.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port = \" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(req);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(port, () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Server is running on port \" /><text value=\"${port}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"express\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"app\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"port\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>req</code>, a następnie <code>res</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nazwij obiekt żądania <code>req</code>, a obiekt odpowiedzi <code>res</code>. Wyświetl przychodzący obiekt żądania.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port = \" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(req);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(port, () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Server is running on port \" /><text value=\"${port}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"124\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"app\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"port\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"express\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>req</code>, następnie <code>res</code> i na końcu <code>req</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: res.status()",
            "id": 121772,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ustaw status HTTP odpowiedzi na <code>404</code> i wyślij element <code>h1</code> z komunikatem \"404 Page Not Found\".</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port = \" /><text value=\"5000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/about&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`New request made: \" /><text value=\"${req.method}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;&lt;h1&gt;404 Page Not Found&lt;/h1&gt;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(port, () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`The server is listening on port \" /><text value=\"${port}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"167\" endIndex=\"173\" /><option startIndex=\"174\" endIndex=\"177\" /><option startIndex=\"179\" endIndex=\"183\" /><option startIndex=\"184\" endIndex=\"213\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"redirect\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"The server is listening on port 5000\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"New request made: GET\" /></content></output></code><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"correct\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;title&gt;Page Title&lt;/title&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1&gt;404 Page Not Found&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>status</code>, następnie <code>404</code>, a potem <code>send</code>, <code>\"&lt;h1&gt;404 Page Not Found&lt;/h1&gt;\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ustaw status <code>404</code> i wyślij element <code>h1</code> z komunikatem <code>404 Page Not Found</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port = \" /><text value=\"5000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/about&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`New request made: \" /><text value=\"${req.method}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;&lt;h1&gt;404 Page Not Found&lt;/h1&gt;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(port, () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`The server is listening on port \" /><text value=\"${port}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"167\" endIndex=\"173\" /><option startIndex=\"174\" endIndex=\"177\" /><option startIndex=\"179\" endIndex=\"183\" /><option startIndex=\"184\" endIndex=\"213\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;&lt;p&gt;404 Page Not Found&lt;/p&gt;&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"The server is listening on port 5000\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"New request made: GET\" /></content></output></code><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"correct\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;title&gt;Page Title&lt;/title&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1&gt;404 Page Not Found&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>status</code>, następnie <code>404</code>, <code>send</code> i na końcu <code>\"&lt;h1&gt;404 Page Not Found&lt;/h1&gt;\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18 - Copy",
            "id": 132660,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Który adres URL zawiera tylko parametry zapytania i nie zawiera parametrów trasy?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>/items/42?sort=asc</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>/items?id=42&amp;sort=asc</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>/items?id=42&amp;sort=asc</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Który adres URL zawiera tylko parametry zapytania i nie zawiera parametrów trasy?</p><p>Znajdź adres URL, w którym zarówno <code>id</code>, jak i <code>sort</code> są parametrami zapytania.</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>/items/42?sort=asc</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>/items?id=42&amp;sort=asc</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.body</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>/items?id=42&amp;sort=asc</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132658,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podaj wartość domyślną, jeśli parametr zapytania ma wartość <code>undefined</code> lub <code>null</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name || \" /><text value=\"&quot;Guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Hello, \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"req.params.name\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Guest\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>req.query.name</code>, następnie <code>||</code> i na końcu <code>\"Guest\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Odczytaj parametr zapytania <code>name</code>. Użyj <code>Guest</code>, gdy go brakuje lub jest pusty. Zachowaj podane imiona.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name || \" /><text value=\"&quot;Guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Hello, \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"req.params.name\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"??\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Maria&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Guest!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>req.query.name</code>, następnie <code>||</code> i na końcu <code>\"Guest\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Accessing Specific Endpoints",
            "id": 120187,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Skonfiguruj katalog główny i katalog <code>profiles</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"'express'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"'/'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.send(\" /><text value=\"'Hello from the root directory!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"'/profiles'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.send(\" /><text value=\"'Hello from the profiles directory!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Server is running on port 3000`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"151\" endIndex=\"152\" /><option startIndex=\"152\" endIndex=\"160\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"users\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"root\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>/</code>, następnie <code>/</code> i na końcu <code>profiles</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zarejestruj trasy GET dla katalogu głównego i stałej ścieżki <code>/profiles</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"'express'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"'/'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.send(\" /><text value=\"'Hello from the root directory!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"'/profiles'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.send(\" /><text value=\"'Hello from the profiles directory!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Server is running on port 3000`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"151\" endIndex=\"152\" /><option startIndex=\"152\" endIndex=\"160\" /><option startIndex=\"146\" endIndex=\"149\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":profiles\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"root\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>/</code>, następnie <code>get</code>, <code>/</code> i na końcu <code>profiles</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: res.send()",
            "id": 121768,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaka metoda wysyła odpowiedź HTTP z powrotem do frontendu?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>res.send()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>res.append()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>res.status()</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>res.redirect()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>res.send()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaka metoda wysyła odpowiedź HTTP z powrotem do frontendu?</p><p>Wybierz metodę obiektu odpowiedzi, która wysyła ukończoną odpowiedź HTTP do frontendu.</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>res.send()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>res.append()</code> wysyła kompletną odpowiedź</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>res.status()</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>res.redirect()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>res.send()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
